       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI51302.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI51302.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Reporting Correspondentes
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI51302         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5807 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7302 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5130.
       COPY SWCV5131.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 SW-CURSOR                  PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-NONE                    VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-1                       VALUE '1'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-2                       VALUE '2'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-3                       VALUE '3'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-4                       VALUE '4'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5807                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5807'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWVT7302                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7302'.
      *    05 CON-RECONCILIADO              PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
      *    05 CON-NRECONCILIADO             PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
      *    05 CON-MANUAL                    PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
      *    05 CON-AMBOS                     PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-CCODEST-PENDENTE          PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO      PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
PML24      05 CON-CCODEST-SUGERIDO          PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
PML24 *    05 CON-CCODEST-VALIDADO          PIC  X(02) VALUE 'VA'.
           05 CON-DATA-MINIMA               PIC S9(08) COMP-3
                                                       VALUE +10101.
           05 CON-DATA-MAXIMA               PIC S9(08) COMP-3
                                                       VALUE +99991231.
           05 CON-NAO                       PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-SIM                       PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-CREDITO                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'C'.
           05 CON-DEBITO                    PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MAX-RECORDS               PIC  9(10) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-COUNT                     PIC S9(10) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.

           05 WS-CSEND                     PIC  X(12) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CSEND.
              10 WS-C2COD-CBAN             PIC  X(04).
              10 WS-C2COD-CSPAI            PIC  X(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(06).

           05 WS-CCONTA                    PIC  X(20) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CCONTA.
              10 WS-CCOD-NCCCBALC          PIC  9(04).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-CCOD-NCCCCCB           PIC  X(13).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(02).

           05 WS-CSBALC                    PIC S9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-CSMOED                    PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-MONTANTE                  PIC  ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZ9,99.

           05 WS-SOMA-POSITIVA             PIC S9(15)V9(02)
                                                      COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA             PIC S9(15)V9(02)
                                                      COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-COUNT-POSITIVA            PIC S9(10) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA            PIC S9(10) COMP-3 VALUE 0.

           05 WS-DATAVL-MIN                PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-DATAVL-MAX                PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
PML24 *    05 WS-IRECONC1                  PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACE.
PML24 *    05 WS-IRECONC2                  PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACE.
PML24 *    05 WS-IRECONC3                  PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACE.
PML24 *    05 WS-CCODEST1                  PIC  X(02) VALUE SPACES.
PML24 *    05 WS-CCODEST2                  PIC  X(02) VALUE SPACES.
PML24 *    05 WS-CCODEST3                  PIC  X(02) VALUE SPACES.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI51302'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI51302         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5130-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5130-ASE               TO SWCV5131-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5130-ADE       TO SWCV5131-ADE.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-SLDCONTAB.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-SLDEXT.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-VALID.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-LQTDDEBITO.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-LSLDDEBITO.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-LQTDCREDITO.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-LSLDCREDITO.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-CQTDDEBITO.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-CSLDDEBITO.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO SWCV5131-CQTDCREDITO.

           MOVE SWCV5130-CSEND             TO SWCV5131-CSEND.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CCONTA            TO SWCV5131-CCONTA.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CMOED             TO SWCV5131-CMOED.
PML24 *    MOVE SWCV5130-IRECONC           TO SWCV5131-IRECONC.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CINTERV           TO SWCV5131-CINTERV.
           MOVE SWCV5130-GUSERNAME         TO SWCV5131-GUSERNAME.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CPERFIL           TO SWCV5131-CPERFIL.
      *    MOVE SWCV5130-DDATAI            TO SWCV5131-DDATAI.
      *    MOVE SWCV5130-DDATAF            TO SWCV5131-DDATAF.
           MOVE SWCV5130-DDATA             TO SWCV5131-DDATA.

           MOVE SWCV5130-CSEND             TO WS-CSEND.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CCONTA            TO WS-CCONTA.
PML24 *    MOVE CON-NRECONCILIADO          TO WS-IRECONC1.
PML24 *    MOVE CON-RECONCILIADO           TO WS-IRECONC2.
PML24 *    MOVE CON-MANUAL                 TO WS-IRECONC3.

      *    MOVE SWCV5130-DDATAI            TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
      *    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
      *       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
      *    MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO WS-DATAVL-MIN.
      *
      *    MOVE CON-DATA-MAXIMA            TO WS-DATAVL-MAX.
      *    IF SWCV5130-DDATAF NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
      *       MOVE SWCV5130-DDATAF         TO AQCW0005-DTX10
      *       PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
      *          THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT
      *       MOVE AQCW0005-DT98           TO WS-DATAVL-MAX
      *    END-IF.

           MOVE CON-DATA-MAXIMA            TO WS-DATAVL-MAX.
           IF SWCV5130-DDATA  NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
              MOVE SWCV5130-DDATA          TO AQCW0005-DTX10
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DT98           TO WS-DATAVL-MAX
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-SALDO-CORRESP
                 THRU 2299-SALDO-CORRESP-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2300-SALDO-EXTRATO
                 THRU 2399-SALDO-EXTRATO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2400-CORRESPONDENTES
                 THRU 2499-CORRESPONDENTES-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2500-EXTRATOS
                 THRU 2599-EXTRATOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              COMPUTE SWCV5131-VALID =
                      SWCV5131-SLDCONTAB - SWCV5131-SLDEXT -
                      SWCV5131-LSLDCREDITO + SWCV5131-LSLDDEBITO -
                      SWCV5131-CSLDCREDITO + SWCV5131-CSLDDEBITO
           END-IF.

       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-SALDO-CORRESP
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-SALDO-CORRESP.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-SALDO-CORRESP'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE WS-CCOD-NCCCBALC           TO SWCD7302-NBALC.
           MOVE WS-CCOD-NCCCCCB            TO SWCD7302-CCB.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CBAN              TO SWCD7302-CBAN.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CSPAI             TO SWCD7302-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CMOED             TO SWCD7302-CMOED.
           MOVE CON-SIM                    TO SWCD7302-ISALDMOV.

      *    IF SWCV5130-DDATAF NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
      *       MOVE SWCV5130-DDATAF         TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MAXIMA    TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
      *    END-IF.

           IF SWCV5130-DDATA  NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
              MOVE SWCV5130-DDATA          TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MAXIMA    TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT MSALDMOV
                INTO :SWCD7302-MSALDMOV
                FROM SWVT7302
               WHERE CBAN      =  :SWCD7302-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI     =  :SWCD7302-CSPAI
                 AND CMOED     =  :SWCD7302-CMOED
                 AND NBALC     =  :SWCD7302-NBALC
                 AND CCB       =  :SWCD7302-CCB
                 AND DATVAL   <=  :SWCD7302-DATVAL
                 AND ISALDMOV  =  :SWCD7302-ISALDMOV
                 ORDER BY DATVAL DESC
                 FETCH FIRST ROW ONLY
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7302               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE ZEROES               TO SWCD7302-MSALDMOV
                                              SWCV5131-SLDCONTAB
              ELSE
                 IF DB2-OK
                    MOVE SWCD7302-MSALDMOV TO SWCV5131-SLDCONTAB
                 ELSE
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC   TO SWCV5131-CSEND-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2299-SALDO-CORRESP-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2300-SALDO-EXTRATO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2300-SALDO-EXTRATO.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-SALDO-EXTRATO'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE WS-CCOD-NCCCBALC           TO SWCD7302-NBALC.
           MOVE WS-CCOD-NCCCCCB            TO SWCD7302-CCB.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CBAN              TO SWCD7302-CBAN.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CSPAI             TO SWCD7302-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CMOED             TO SWCD7302-CMOED.
           MOVE CON-SIM                    TO SWCD7302-ISALDEXT.

      *    IF SWCV5130-DDATAF NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
      *       MOVE SWCV5130-DDATAF         TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MAXIMA    TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
      *    END-IF.

           IF SWCV5130-DDATA  NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
              MOVE SWCV5130-DDATA          TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MAXIMA    TO SWCD7302-DATVAL
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT MSALDEXT
                INTO :SWCD7302-MSALDEXT
                FROM SWVT7302
               WHERE CBAN      = :SWCD7302-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI     = :SWCD7302-CSPAI
                 AND CMOED     = :SWCD7302-CMOED
                 AND NBALC     =  :SWCD7302-NBALC
                 AND CCB       =  :SWCD7302-CCB
                 AND DATVAL   <= :SWCD7302-DATVAL
                 AND ISALDEXT  = :SWCD7302-ISALDEXT
                 ORDER BY DATVAL DESC
                 FETCH FIRST ROW ONLY
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7302               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE ZEROES               TO SWCD7302-MSALDEXT
                                              SWCV5131-SLDEXT
              ELSE
                 IF DB2-OK
                    MOVE SWCD7302-MSALDEXT TO SWCV5131-SLDEXT
                 ELSE
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC   TO SWCV5131-CSEND-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2399-SALDO-EXTRATO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2400-CORRESPONDENTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2400-CORRESPONDENTES.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2400-CORRESPONDENTES'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE WS-CCOD-NCCCBALC           TO SWCD7204-MRBALC.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CBAN              TO SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CSPAI             TO SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI.
           MOVE WS-CCOD-NCCCCCB            TO SWCD7204-MRCCB.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CMOED             TO SWCD7204-MRMOED.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2410-CORRESP-CREDITO
                 THRU 2419-CORRESP-CREDITO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2420-CORRESP-DEBITO
                 THRU 2429-CORRESP-DEBITO-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2499-CORRESPONDENTES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2410-CORRESP-CREDITO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2410-CORRESP-CREDITO.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2410-CORRESP-CREDITO ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-SOMA-POSITIVA
                                              WS-COUNT-POSITIVA.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL(SUM(MRVLR), 0)
                   , IFNULL(COUNT(MRVLR), 0)
                INTO :WS-SOMA-POSITIVA
                   , :WS-COUNT-POSITIVA
                FROM SWVT7204
               WHERE MRBALC    =  :SWCD7204-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB     =  :SWCD7204-MRCCB
                 AND NCCCCBAN  =  :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI =  :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                 AND MRMOED    =  :SWCD7204-MRMOED
      *          AND IRECONC   IN ( :WS-IRECONC1
      *                           , :WS-IRECONC2
      *                           , :WS-IRECONC3 )
PML24 *          AND IRECONC   <> :CON-RECONCILIADO
PML24            AND CCODEST   <> :CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO
      *          AND MRDATL    BETWEEN :WS-DATAVL-MIN
      *                            AND :WS-DATAVL-MAX
                 AND MRDATL    <= :WS-DATAVL-MAX
                 AND MRVLR     > 0
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 MOVE WS-COUNT-POSITIVA    TO SWCV5131-LQTDCREDITO
                 MOVE WS-SOMA-POSITIVA     TO SWCV5131-LSLDCREDITO
              ELSE
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV5131-CSEND-CAPLIC
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2419-CORRESP-CREDITO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2420-CORRESP-DEBITO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2420-CORRESP-DEBITO.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2420-CORRESP-DEBITO  ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA
                                              WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL(SUM(MRVLR), 0)
                   , IFNULL(COUNT(MRVLR), 0)
                INTO :WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA
                   , :WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA
                FROM SWVT7204
               WHERE MRBALC    =  :SWCD7204-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB     =  :SWCD7204-MRCCB
                 AND NCCCCBAN  =  :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI =  :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                 AND MRMOED    =  :SWCD7204-MRMOED
      *          AND IRECONC   IN ( :WS-IRECONC1
      *                           , :WS-IRECONC2
      *                           , :WS-IRECONC3 )
PML24 *          AND IRECONC   <> :CON-RECONCILIADO
PML24            AND CCODEST   <> :CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO
      *          AND MRDATL    BETWEEN :WS-DATAVL-MIN
      *                            AND :WS-DATAVL-MAX
                 AND MRDATL    <= :WS-DATAVL-MAX
                 AND MRVLR     < 0
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 MOVE WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA    TO SWCV5131-LQTDDEBITO
                 MULTIPLY WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA BY -1
                                       GIVING SWCV5131-LSLDDEBITO
PRA   *          MOVE WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA     TO SWCV5131-LSLDDEBITO
              ELSE
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV5131-CSEND-CAPLIC
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2429-CORRESP-DEBITO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2500-EXTRATOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2500-EXTRATOS.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2500-EXTRATOS     '    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

PML24 *    EVALUATE SWCV5130-IRECONC
PML24 *      WHEN CON-NRECONCILIADO
PML24 *        MOVE CON-CCODEST-PENDENTE     TO WS-CCODEST1
PML24 *                                         WS-CCODEST2
PML24 *                                         WS-CCODEST3
PML24 *      WHEN CON-RECONCILIADO
PML24 *        MOVE CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO TO WS-CCODEST1
PML24 *        MOVE CON-CCODEST-VALIDADO     TO WS-CCODEST2
PML24 *                                         WS-CCODEST3
PML24 *                                         WS-CCODEST3
PML24 *      WHEN CON-AMBOS
PML24 *        MOVE CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO TO WS-CCODEST1
PML24 *        MOVE CON-CCODEST-VALIDADO     TO WS-CCODEST2
PML24 *        MOVE CON-CCODEST-PENDENTE     TO WS-CCODEST3
PML24 *    END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE WS-C2COD-CBAN              TO SWCD5807-CBAN.
           MOVE WS-C2COD-CSPAI             TO SWCD5807-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV5130-CMOED             TO SWCD5807-CMOED.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2510-EXTRATO-CREDITO
                 THRU 2519-EXTRATO-CREDITO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2520-EXTRATO-DEBITO
                 THRU 2529-EXTRATO-DEBITO-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2599-EXTRATOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2510-EXTRATO-CREDITO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2510-EXTRATO-CREDITO.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2510-EXTRATO-CREDITO ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-SOMA-POSITIVA
                                              WS-COUNT-POSITIVA.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL(SUM(MVALOR), 0)
                   , IFNULL(COUNT(MVALOR), 0)
                INTO :WS-SOMA-POSITIVA
                   , :WS-COUNT-POSITIVA
                FROM SWVT5807
               WHERE CBAN    =  :SWCD5807-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI   =  :SWCD5807-CSPAI
                 AND CMOED   =  :SWCD5807-CMOED
      *          AND DATVAL  BETWEEN :WS-DATAVL-MIN
      *                          AND :WS-DATAVL-MAX
                 AND DATVAL  <= :WS-DATAVL-MAX
      *          AND CCODEST IN ( :WS-CCODEST1
      *                         , :WS-CCODEST2
      *                         , :WS-CCODEST3 )
                 AND CCODEST <> :CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO
                 AND CDBCR   = :CON-CREDITO
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5807               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 MOVE WS-COUNT-POSITIVA    TO SWCV5131-CQTDCREDITO
                 MOVE WS-SOMA-POSITIVA     TO SWCV5131-CSLDCREDITO
              ELSE
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV5131-CSEND-CAPLIC
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2519-EXTRATO-CREDITO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2520-EXTRATO-DEBITO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2520-EXTRATO-DEBITO.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2520-EXTRATO-DEBITO  ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA
                                              WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL(SUM(MVALOR), 0)
                   , IFNULL(COUNT(MVALOR), 0)
                INTO :WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA
                   , :WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA
                FROM SWVT5807
               WHERE CBAN        =  :SWCD5807-CBAN
                 AND CSPAI       =  :SWCD5807-CSPAI
                 AND CMOED       =  :SWCD5807-CMOED
      *          AND DATVAL      BETWEEN :WS-DATAVL-MIN
      *                              AND :WS-DATAVL-MAX
                 AND DATVAL      <= :WS-DATAVL-MAX
      *          AND CCODEST     IN ( :WS-CCODEST1
      *                             , :WS-CCODEST2
      *                             , :WS-CCODEST3 )
                 AND CCODEST <> :CON-CCODEST-RECONCILIADO
                 AND CDBCR   = :CON-DEBITO
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5807               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 MOVE WS-COUNT-NEGATIVA    TO SWCV5131-CQTDDEBITO
PRA   *          COMPUTE WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA = WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA * -1
                 MOVE WS-SOMA-NEGATIVA     TO SWCV5131-CSLDDEBITO
              ELSE
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-S
                 MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                                           TO SWCV5131-CSEND-MSG
                 MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV5131-CSEND-CAPLIC
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2529-EXTRATO-DEBITO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5131-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5131-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5131-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
